{"game": "mass-effect-andromeda", "language": "english", "appid": 1238000, "month": "2024-07", "window": 1, "start_date": 1719792000, "end_date": 1720396799, "month_true_total": 111, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 22:00:12 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "169283947", "author": {"steamid": "76561198040678058", "personaname": "Tumoril", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198040678058/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 5857, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1089, "last_played": 1729031529, "avatar": "e036f1dd2039f229546f81ac282ffe98914f7829"}, "language": "english", "review": "I love Mass Effect, the original is my favorite game of all time.  \r\nThe gameplay is great and the it's fun exploring a new galaxy.\r\n\r\nThat said I can't recommend it, the number of times it pops into windowed mode, and more frequently the number of times it has an infinite loading screen where you have to load back several saves to get it to work is practically game breaking.\r\n\r\nThe fact that EA and Bioware have not patched this to be 100% after all these years is jaw dropping.", "timestamp_created": 1720392127, "timestamp_updated": 1720392127, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.512143611907958984", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "169257214", "author": {"steamid": "76561198273458208", "personaname": "Kane", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198273458208/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 2580, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1190, "last_played": 1721574979, "avatar": "3fdd46b8153f022cf78649af19d1ba660c6a0aea"}, "language": "english", "review": "One of the best RPG's on the market, ever.", "timestamp_created": 1720372067, "timestamp_updated": 1720372067, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "169250224", "author": {"steamid": "76561198343457795", "personaname": "ThjioybhJieayh", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Sz1lv3s/", "num_games_owned": 608, "num_reviews": 197, "playtime_forever": 3565, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3565, "last_played": 1720366596, "avatar": "738345e90541ec9e092fdad6321ae639eed49e4b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Massively overhated. \nIt deserved a whole trilogy. \nShame people expected it to live up to the first trilogy. \nIt never could have and it never should have. \nIt was meant to be different, in some ways better, in others worse. \nI enjoyed my time with it, and it pains my heart to know, it will never have a sequel.\nIt was great fun.", "timestamp_created": 1720366753, "timestamp_updated": 1720366753, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.5", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 18, "count": 2}]}, {"recommendationid": "169240156", "author": {"steamid": "76561198086416837", "personaname": "qrow", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198086416837/", "num_games_owned": 359, "num_reviews": 27, "playtime_forever": 4385, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4385, "last_played": 1720359070, "avatar": "06298ac5d55fbd10cc102cf76058344cf31a4